# Files a CS Party browser client opens, traced from a native Xash3D client across
# de_dust2 (board + minigames), csp_surf and csp_bhop (strace -e openat). Paths only.
# Maps, overviews and WADs are added by pack_gamedata.py from the map list.
# Regenerate with tools/dev/trace_client.sh after adding maps, models or sounds.
